      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="Fjord & Form — home">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#faf8f4;color:#1b1a17">F</span>
          <span style="color:#faf8f4">Fjord &amp; Form<small>Stavanger · Est. 2016</small></span>
        </a>
        <p>Interior architecture for workplaces, hospitality and homes across Rogaland — and beyond.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem"><span class="badge" style="background:#232220;border-color:#3a3935;color:#e9e4d8"><span class="badge-dot"></span>Rebuilt in Astro · Hosted on Cloudflare</span></p>
