    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>© <span data-year>{year}</span> Fjord &amp; Form AS · Org. 123 456 789</span>
      <span>Webflow → Astro demo · <a href="/migration">Migration notes</a> · <a href="/contact">Privacy on request</a></span>
